    <statement><p>Perform the indicated operation.  Simplify the result, if possible.
 <me>11 - \frac{5}{15x}</me></p>
<p>Answer:  <fillin characters="25" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><url>help(entering your answer)</url></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{33x+50}{3x+5}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><p>The LCD is <m>3x5</m>.
<me>\begin{aligned} 
11 - \frac{5}{15x} \amp  = \frac{11}{1} \cdot \frac{3x5}{3x5} - \frac{5}{15x} \\
          \amp  = \frac{33x55}{3x5} - \frac{5}{3x5} \\
          \amp  = \frac{33x+50}{3x+5}               
\end{aligned}</me></p>
</solution>
